From fe7e2da058fbd4bd60b7b9e6297cddb20c1dd916 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lakr233 <git@qaq.wiki>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 21:20:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 57/68] vgpu: synchronize ColorInput feedback passes, compute
 debt and native merges

Add VK_IMAGE_USAGE_ATTACHMENT_FEEDBACK_LOOP_BIT_EXT to registry_target_usage so secondary MRT attachments and recycled colour residents disable incompatible framebuffer compression on attachment feedback loop hosts, set COLOR_ATTACHMENT_FEEDBACK_LOOP_EXT on graphics pipelines with color_inputs, include FRAGMENT_SHADER/INPUT_ATTACHMENT_READ in pre-pass barriers, keep MRT render passes open across layout-matching continuations, and emit an intra-subpass BY_REGION barrier for color_inputs programmable blending.

Also settle deferred render writebacks before serving compute linear-texture cache hits, convert RGBA32Float CPU texels, and support skipping native merges on wide surfaces.
